193	    // connection while the retry policy decides (possibly after a timeout) and
194	    // must resume the same one. Routing this through controllerProxy would risk
195	    // resuming a different connection if a later dispatch re-points the proxy in
196	    // between, leaving this one paused forever -- the very stall the proxy exists
197	    // to prevent.
